        "Content": "<ul><li>Exceptional Victorian residence extending to approx. 389 sq.m / 4188 sq. ft</li><li>Beautifully appointed and curated family home</li><li>Impressive period detail with embellished cornicing and central ceiling roses</li><li>Beautifully proportioned reception rooms with marble fireplaces</li><li>Five luxurious bedrooms, three with wonderful en-suite bathrooms.</li><li>Five reception rooms</li><li>Bespoke English style kitchen and Hamptons style breakfast room with French doors to garden</li><li>Beautiful painted walls by renowned artist Christopher Moore to bathrooms and cloak rooms</li><li>Southwest facing rear garden designed by landscape architect David Koning</li><li>Superb location with walking distance to Ranelagh, Ballsbridge Village, St Stephens Green and Dublin city center</li><li>Restored in 2007 to exacting standards</li><li>Surround sound</li><li>Brass and chrome ironmongery throughout</li><li>Recess lighting</li><li>Secure off-street parking behind electric controlled gates</li><li>GFCH</li><li>BER Exempt</li></ul>"
